```json
{
  "fruits": [
    {
      "name": "apple",
      "color": "red",
      "size": "medium"
    },
    {
      "name": "banana",
      "color": "yellow",
      "size": "medium"
    },
    {
      "name": "orange",
      "color": "orange",
      "size": "medium"
    }
  ]
}
```

This JSON object contains three arrays of three strings, each representing a fruit. The key "fruits" holds an array of three strings, and the values are the corresponding fruits.
